  "body": "Browsers seem to set `text-transform: none` on form fields in their user-agent stylesheet. Should this be specified in the Rendering section?\n\nhttps://mxr.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/source/layout/style/res/forms.css?rev=e56017a57ea7#93\nhttps://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/19b50f20c2da2f0f3efddd91e3df57ba4a4e8b15/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/css/html.css#406\n\nCC https://github.com/servo/servo/issues/11362.\n",
